1
00:00:02,252 --> 00:00:06,252
(Leonard:)On the other hand, some physicists are
concerned that if this supercollider works...

2
00:00:06,423 --> 00:00:10,343
...it'll create a black hole and swallow up
the Earth, ending life as we know it.

3
00:00:10,510 --> 00:00:12,550
(Raj:)What a bunch of crybabies.

4
00:00:12,721 --> 00:00:14,971
(Raj:)No guts, no glory, man.

5
00:00:15,432 --> 00:00:16,932
(Leonard(looking at an orange notice on the noticeboard):)Hey, check it out.

6
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:20,100
(Leonard(looking at an orange notice on the noticeboard):)The School of Pharmacology
is looking for volunteers.

7
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:22,770
"We are testing a new medication
for social anxiety...

8
00:00:22,939 --> 00:00:27,689
(Raj:)...panic attacks, agoraphobia
and obsessive-compulsive disorder."

9
00:00:28,570 --> 00:00:30,820
(Raj:)Why would they be looking
for test subjects here?

10
00:00:32,157 --> 00:00:33,447
(Leonard:)I don't know, Raj.

11
00:00:33,616 --> 00:00:36,956
Maybe the comic-book store
doesn't have a bulletin board.

12
00:00:39,873 --> 00:00:42,293
- What's going on?
- Shh! Hot girl in Sheldon's office.

13
00:00:43,585 --> 00:00:44,665
(Leonard:)Sheldon's office?

14
00:00:46,755 --> 00:00:48,835
(Leonard:)Is she lost?

15
00:00:49,299 --> 00:00:52,639
(Missy:)I don't think so.
I followed her here from the parking lot.

16
00:00:54,637 --> 00:00:58,437
- Maybe she's his lawyer.
- Well, she's free to examine my briefs.

17
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:00,140
(Sheldon:)- Howard...
- I know, I'm disgusting.

18
00:01:00,310 --> 00:01:01,390
(Howard:)I should be punished.

